WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.370
Start a new empty ChatGPT Work chat. (3× speed)

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:00.908
Choose the workshop book from the computer. (3× speed)

00:00:00.908 --> 00:00:01.110
The workshop book is attached. (3× speed)

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:06.179
Write the request using the attached book. (3× speed)

00:00:06.179 --> 00:00:06.877
Select the installed learn skill. (3× speed)

00:00:06.877 --> 00:00:09.015
Read the complete request and selected skill.

00:00:09.015 --> 00:00:09.466
Send the book and the skill request. (3× speed)

00:00:09.466 --> 00:00:09.919
ChatGPT prepares the skill response. (4× speed)

00:00:09.919 --> 00:00:15.799
Read the diagnostic question before answering.

00:00:15.799 --> 00:00:16.111
Test a plausible misconception.

00:00:16.111 --> 00:00:23.257
Focus the Work learner answer

00:00:23.257 --> 00:00:23.871
Send the Work learner answer

00:00:23.871 --> 00:00:24.540
ChatGPT prepares source-linked feedback. (4× speed)

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:29.805
Use source-linked feedback to correct the misconception.

00:00:29.805 --> 00:00:29.981
Try again with a corrected explanation.

00:00:29.981 --> 00:00:37.226
Focus the Work learner answer

00:00:37.226 --> 00:00:37.707
Send the Work learner answer

00:00:37.707 --> 00:00:38.384
ChatGPT prepares source-linked feedback. (4× speed)

00:00:38.384 --> 00:00:43.677
Apply the correction to retrieval-augmented generation.

00:00:43.677 --> 00:00:44.006
Transfer the explanation to RAG and its limits.

00:00:44.006 --> 00:00:57.796
Focus the Work learner answer

00:00:57.796 --> 00:00:58.614
Send the Work learner answer

00:00:58.614 --> 00:00:59.215
ChatGPT prepares source-linked feedback. (4× speed)

00:00:59.215 --> 00:01:05.489
Check the transfer answer and the source references.

00:01:05.489 --> 00:01:05.681
Complete the independent check on training.

00:01:05.681 --> 00:01:14.429
Focus the Work learner answer

00:01:14.429 --> 00:01:14.952
Send the Work learner answer

00:01:14.952 --> 00:01:15.612
ChatGPT prepares source-linked feedback. (4× speed)

00:01:15.612 --> 00:01:21.853
Check the final feedback and repeat the explanation independently.

00:01:21.853 --> 00:01:27.383
Create a link to the completed conversation.
